  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "61baed41-7e14-4615-af1e-0150c6d0a15f",
      "udi": "umb://element/ab53b8e94bf04cb9bf2c8aba70f61d1d"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/9e34feaf107d4032a22a4c00acadc480",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Using the block grid editor you can pick a 'Box' as a component rather than applying the class, and add any block inside the box. </p>\n<p>This example isn't inside a column layout.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3fa201d9-0d89-458f-b6dc-f5fb6fc8e10a",
      "udi": "umb://element/a3c8b6d990b6412397bbadf2dcfa6eda"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/f96fe10a21c9404b8c6d15a6e931af21",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Boxes work when placed in a column.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/2443192098bd47d09bae82cbe99f9967",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>You can add bordered boxes too.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/723bf915e0994a0282ad91dba6f3dba2",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a solid box in a one-third single column layout. The single column layout allows a divider to be applied and the width to be configured.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "77726c2e-3248-4fab-bb3a-478e65ba9256",
      "udi": "umb://element/e0f1972f52af491ea0ddb53b0bbc75d4"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "61baed41-7e14-4615-af1e-0150c6d0a15f",
      "udi": "umb://element/82366f5cf9b04a389434f26b560ec039"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3fa201d9-0d89-458f-b6dc-f5fb6fc8e10a",
      "udi": "umb://element/7c931c798127425a98b92e3c953825ab"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/eb657806e8ed4b91a142a48bd2a35eb2",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This content is within a column, in a box with the style set to bordered.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/435f4ca498a346248e7490c3127e3040",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This content is in another box, within a column in a box with the style set to bordered.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "61baed41-7e14-4615-af1e-0150c6d0a15f",
      "udi": "umb://element/2cf19a5a19fd49f4a3f5ed6b093f1f0d"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/853131dc44cd40d2b0ff76dde6e39606",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a box directly within another box.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/7a673e01a68745f3ad99f4067720b0ec",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a box directly within another box. There should be even spacing between this box and the box above, and between this box and the outer box.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "650d7119-e9cf-4c26-a08c-21cf2ffbbbbc",
      "udi": "umb://element/3da0a195884f48adbb196a44482a444f"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3fa201d9-0d89-458f-b6dc-f5fb6fc8e10a",
      "udi": "umb://element/98c9e71662474fa1bb6d8cfa12a0dde7"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/b9ec40879ad747adae16f6972a2d2cc0",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a box inside the second column of the two-thirds/one-third layout.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "61baed41-7e14-4615-af1e-0150c6d0a15f",
      "udi": "umb://element/9ef9f127c3fd407783191ea10c660319"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f7721eea-7712-4d9c-91e4-9c04f0ad3036",
      "udi": "umb://element/9709ea00160e4959b8a933e2182dbf9c"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/48c810755b704c728eb045f730db212e",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This box has a three-column layout inside.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/13ec193a3f744463b0e5947aa0018040",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This box has a three-column layout inside.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/6d4330de355c4e27879ffa8fbae985d1",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This box has a three-column layout inside.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/49f62a11de7a46b49e760fd8b26ddde0",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a box inside the first column of a two-column layout inside a two-thirds/one-third layout.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/85fc472896374a6785b9e0ee9a54fed3",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is a box inside the first column of a two-column layout inside a two-thirds/one-third layout.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/382a58edd84640748db8375b553b2c7e",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Boxes can be within nested column layouts. This text is inside a two-thirds/one-third layout, and is followed by a two-column layout with boxes inside each column.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3fa201d9-0d89-458f-b6dc-f5fb6fc8e10a",
      "udi": "umb://element/b7e87702ccc046bb8ce5c3f78cba7c8f"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "udi": "umb://element/704aa73f941b49039e0209e167df6058",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>This is the same example, except that the columns remain stacked at the tablet breakpoint.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
